  "body": "**Blocked by:** #190\n\n## Context\n\nThis issue builds on #190 and completes the `deployment` batch.\n\n## Task\n\nAdd rollback mode validating an existing prior release, atomically repointing current and restarting without build or schema unwind. Codify previous-release compatibility, expand-contract/two-release rename-removal, and fix-forward migrations; add mechanical examples/checks where possible.\n\n## Scope\n\n### In scope\n\n- Task deliverables, migrations, integration, tests, and necessary documentation.\n\n### Out of scope\n\n- No down migrations or per-package rollback.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- Rollback uses existing release and no schema mutation.\n- Invalid rollback leaves current unchanged.\n- Accepted/rejected migration examples are concrete.\n- Compatibility fixture runs previous code after additive migration.\n",
